aily operations but can dramatically impact local economies. It’s in these moments when businesses need help the most. Focus on Energy, in partnership with the Wisconsin Office of Energy Innovation (OEI), is offering businesses impacted by natural disasters an additional 25% in Focus on Energy incentives. Natural disasters include snowstorms, thunderstorms, hailstorms, floods, tornadoes, and wildfires. Other weather events, such as extreme temperatures, are not considered a natural disaster. Participation Requirements : Bonus is available on New Construction prescriptive rebates only. Bonus is available exclusively on equipment installed in the facility damaged by the natural disaster. Customers must have a participating electric or natural gas utility. Verify your utility participates. All business customers qualify, including agriculture, commercial, industrial, school, and government facilities Projects must be initiated within 12 months of the natural disaster occurring Approval of the Bonus Request is required prior to purchasing equipment Projects must be complete on or before June 30, 2024 Applications must be received within 60 days of installation, no later than August 29, 2024 Complete all sections. Installation must be completed by June 30, 2024 and application must be received within 60 days of installation. © 2026 Focus on Energy Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy", "https://assets.focusonenergy.com/production/images/forms/natural_disaster_relief_barn_1.JPG": "����\u0000\u0010JFIF\u0000\u0001\u0001\u0001\u0000�\u0000�\u0000\u0000�� XICC_PROFILE\u0000\u0001\u0001\u0000\u0000 HLino\u0002\u0010\u0000\u0000mntrRGB XYZ \u0007�\u0000\u0002\u0000 \u0000\u0006\u00001\u0000\u0000acspMSFT\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000IEC sRGB\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0000\u0000��\u0000\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000�-HP \u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u