n and construction process. The 2022 New Construction Trade Ally Award winners and their designated categories are: Kueny Architects: Program Enrollments, Design Assistance - Pleasant Prairie Bray Architects: Design Team Lead, Design Assistance, Non-Residential - Milwaukee, Sheboygan AG Architecture: Design Team Lead, Design Assistance, Residential - Wauwatosa EUA: Architect, Design Assistance – Madison, Milwaukee, DePere Affiliated Engineers, Inc.: Mechanical Engineer, Design Assistance - Madison Salas O'Brien: Electrical Engineer, Design Assistance – Madison, Eau Claire, Verona Mortenson: General Contractor/Construction Manager, Design Assistance - Milwaukee HGA: Design Team Completed Energy Consultant - Milwaukee The New Construction Trade Ally Awards were presented, as part of the program, during the American Institute of Architects Wisconsin 2022 Design Awards Gala held September 16 at Tripoli Shrine Center in Milwaukee. AIA Wisconsin honored their 2022 AIA Wisconsin award recipients, including the Young Architect Award winners, the Golden Award winner, and the Design Award winners. Focus on Energy is a proud sponsor of this event and a 2022 Platinum Partner. For more information visit aia.org/wisconsin . See All Press Join our newsletter to stay up-to-date. Need answers? Try our Help Center. Help Center Looking for something specific? © 2026 Focus on Energy Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy", "https://focusonenergy.com/news/focused-on-the-future-the-city-of-madison-earns-a-2022-energy-efficiency-excellence-award": "Focused on the Future, the City of Madison Earns a… | Focus on Energy New Blog Post: Planting Knowledge for a Better Future >> About Us News Events and Training Find a Trade Ally Contact English English Español Products Free Energy-Saving Packs Online Marketplace Equipment Explore all Rebates Services Building Optimization Energy Assessments Energy Management New Construction & Renovations Technical Support Explore all Rebates Rebates & Incentives L