ies through the Department of Energy. U.S. DOE Clean Energy Infrastructure Funding Announcements Learn more about the clean energy provisions of the IRA managed by the Department of Energy. USDA Rural Energy Assistance Agribusinesses and small businesses located in rural communities are eligible to receive grants through USDA's Rural Energy for America Program (REAP). IRS Tax Info for Commercial Buildings Learn about the financial benefits of investing in energy efficiency for commercial buildings. IRS Tax Credits and Deductions The IRA extended, expanded, and created new tax credits and deductions for clean energy technologies. Elective Pay & Transferability Tax-exempt and governmental entities can now benefit from clean energy tax credits using new options enabled by the Inflation Reduction Act. Tax Credit FAQ Have questions about tax credits? Check out the IRS’s frequently asked questions. Read More Join our newsletter to stay up-to-date. Need answers? Try our Help Center. Help Center Looking for something specific? © 2026 Focus on Energy Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy", "https://focusonenergy.com/evaluation-reports-archive": "Evaluation Reports Archive | Focus on Energy New Blog Post: Planting Knowledge for a Better Future >> About Us News Events and Training Find a Trade Ally Contact English English Español Products Free Energy-Saving Packs Online Marketplace Equipment Explore all Rebates Services Building Optimization Energy Assessments Energy Management New Construction & Renovations Technical Support Explore all Rebates Rebates & Incentives Learn more about our Rebates and Incentives. Explore all Rebates Residential Heating & Cooling Insulation & Air Sealing DIY Insulation & Air Sealing Smart Thermostats Residential Efficient Pumps Water Heating Solar for Homes New Home Certification Income-Qualified Rebates IRA Home Energy Rebates Business Equipment Replacement Rebates for Businesses Custom Incentives Renewables for Businesses Special Offerings New Const