 for your space. Rebates, Results, and Success Access rebates and incentives to reduce upfront costs. Improve business operations. Cut energy costs – without guesswork. For more than 20 years, many Wisconsin businesses have partnered with Focus on Energy. Here are just some of their stories. Success Stories Focused on Flavor and the Future Rising from humble beginnings as a small dairy in Ireland, Kerry Foods has grown into a global leader in the food ingredients industry. Its commitment to innovation, sustainability, and energy efficiency is evident in its operations worldwide, including at its Jackson, Wisconsin facility Read More Sustainability & Unity is Their Ethos Ethos Green Power Cooperative, a Focus on Energy Trade Ally and recipient of a 2024 Energy Efficiency Excellence Award, was founded on a simple yet profound belief: that cooperation is the key to creating a sustainable energy future. Read More Integrating Practical Experiences, Academics, and Energy Efficiency The University of Wisconsin-Stout stands at the forefront of energy efficiency, sustainability, and applied learning. With a focus on sustainable campus initiatives, UW-Stout has become a leader in energy efficiency, serving as a model for other institutions. Read More Join our newsletter to stay up-to-date. Need answers? Try our Help Center. Help Center Looking for something specific? © 2026 Focus on Energy Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy", "https://focusonenergy.com/community-based-organizations": "Community Based Organizations | Focus on Energy New Blog Post: Planting Knowledge for a Better Future >> About Us News Events and Training Find a Trade Ally Contact English English Español Products Free Energy-Saving Packs Online Marketplace Equipment Explore all Rebates Services Building Optimization Energy Assessments Energy Management New Construction & Renovations Technical Support Explore all Rebates Rebates & Incentives Learn more about our Rebates and Incentives. Explore all Rebates Reside