lly Contractors and business leaders who helped shape energy efficiency in Wisconsin. Listen on YouTube Listen on Spotify Listen to More \"Love this program; seriously helps me every year, BIG TIME! I don't believe I could stay as warm without the help from Focus!\" - Greta S., Focus on Energy customer \"...if we keep our focus on energy savings opportunities, we will continue to improve the viability of our mill for years to come.” - BiOrigin Specialty Products, Nick Sovacool, Senior Mill Engineer “Energy efficiency isn’t just about saving money…students are happier, healthier, and able to learn and thrive.” -Monona Grove School District, Dr. Tanya Fredrich, Superintendent “We have really embraced, for many years now, the Focus on Energy program. For us, it has become, really, a way of life.” -Veridian Homes, David Simon, President & Owner “I would like to thank Focus on Energy for the exceptional service. Their assistance allowed us to do these project that we would not have been able to do without their help.” -Great Lake Veneer, Greg Gorski, Director of Manufacturing “As a small, rural district with limited funding, every dollar we save on energy costs allows us to invest more in our students and facilities. It's a win for our schools, community, and taxpayers.” -Osseo-Fairchild School District, Lori Whelan, Superintendent \"It was nice that there was an educational element in the products offered. I didn't realize that electronic products draw even when off.\" - Peg \"Great program! I am sure it has saved us a lot of money over the years. Maybe even thousands. Thank You\" - Robert \"The items included in the pack were high quality and very useful. \" - Chris \"Great products! Most of them are free but even the ones I pay for are at such a good price. I got a Sensi Lite thermostat for my home, and it is incredible!\" - Carolyn \"I have been satisfied with ", "https://focusonenergy.com/get-started": "Get Started | Focus on Energy New Blog Post: Planting Knowledge