 ways it benefits homeowners. Support Wisconsin’s statewide effort to save energy. Ambassador Resources Ambassador Home Guide Benefits for your clients Receive an exclusive new home Welcome Gift with a $125 reimbursement. Gain access to rebates for energy-related home improvements. Connect with certified contractors. Enjoy a more comfortable, energy-efficient home. Here are a few ways Focus on Energy can help your clients enjoy their new homes at their energy-efficient best : Rebates and discounts for heating and cooling equipment, smart thermostats, insulation and air sealing, and more. Free energy-efficient product packs Renewable energy incentives Homebuyers Welcome Gift New Homeowner Tune-Up Application Become an Ambassador At no cost to you, you can gain access to all the exclusive opportunities Focus on Energy has to offer your clients. Simply complete the enrollment application below and sign up for a workshop date to get started. Once you complete your application, you will be directed to sign up for Ambassador Workshop . Please note, all workshops will be offered virtually until further notice. Contact us ambassador@focusonenergy.com 800.762.7077 Sign up Today Join our newsletter to stay up-to-date. Need answers? Try our Help Center. Help Center Looking for something specific? © 2026 Focus on Energy Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy", "https://assets.focusonenergy.com/production/1_Placeholder-Images/Real-estate-agents_408329601.jpeg": "����\u0000\u0010JFIF\u0000\u0001\u0001\u0001\u0001,\u0001,\u0000\u0000��\u0000C\u0000\u0002\u0001\u0001\u0001\u0001\u0001\u0002\u0001\u0001\u0001\u0002\u0002\u0002\u0002\u0002\u0004\u0003\u0002\u0002\u0002\u0002\u0005\u0004\u0004\u0003\u0004\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\u0006\u0007 \b\u0006\u0007 \u0007\u0006\u0006\b \b \u0006\b ��\u0000C\u0001\u0002\u0002\u0002\u0002\u0002\u0002\u0005\u0003\u0003\u0005 \u0007\u0006\u0007 ��\u0000\u0011\b\u000f&\u0010\u000f\u0003\u0001\"\u0000\u0002\u0011\u0001\u0003\u0011\