rgy costs. If you're considering or in the process of building a new multifamily property, look to Focus on Energy to maximize your energy savings opportunities. We provide options to meet your schedule and find incentive opportunities. Express Energy Design Assistance Now available for multifamily development, Express Energy Design Assistance (eEDA) provides online energy modeling for design assistance on your time. With eEDA, design teams create their own whole-building energy model on demand to evaluate efficiency opportunities and support building systems decision-making during design—even into construction. eEDA guides you to financial incentives. Our New Construction Online Tool makes it easy. Get Started Download our Multifamily Development Flyer Multifamily Property Development Overview PDF Want to Learn More? 1 Visit our New Construction and Renovations page New Construction & Renovations 2 Send us a message or give us a call at 800.762.7077 with your questions. Email Us Are You a Property Owner of an Existing Multifamily Building? Focus on Energy offers incentives for in-unit and common area upgrades for multifamily properties with four or more units under one roof. Energy-efficient building improvements are a smart move for property owners as they often lead to: Greater tenant satisfaction and lower turnover rates Fewer maintenance issues and associated costs Lower operating and energy costs LEARN MORE Join our newsletter t", "https://focusonenergy.com/business/ee-best-practice-guides": "Energy Efficiency Best Practices Guides | Focus on Energy New Blog Post: Planting Knowledge for a Better Future >> About Us News Events and Training Find a Trade Ally Contact English English Español Products Free Energy-Saving Packs Online Marketplace Equipment Explore all Rebates Services Building Optimization Energy Assessments Energy Management New Construction & Renovations Technical Support Explore all Rebates Rebates & Incentives Learn more about our Rebates and Inc