 operating costs. Guidebooks Business Summary of Services Business Summary of Services (Spanish) To apply for your rebates, simply download the rebate application and rebate product information sheet. Rebate Application 2026 Rebate Product Information Sheet 2026 Agribusiness Energy-efficient equipment helps farms and ag operations boost production, improve safety, and save money. 2026 2026 Agribusiness Rebate Supplemental Data Sheet [XLSX] 2026 Agribusiness Rebate Supplemental Data Sheet [PDF] 2026 Greenhouse Supplemental Data Sheet [XLSX] 2026 Horticultural Lighting Workbook [XLSM] Learn More Apply Now Building Performance Optimization Targeted tune-ups and system adjustments to improve comfort and efficiency. 2026 2026 SG BPO Guide Fillable [PDF] Apply Now Commercial Refrigeration Energy-efficient refrigeration systems deliver savings for restaurants, stores, and more. 2026 Learn More Apply Now HVAC Lower your heating and cooling costs with improvements to your existing systems or upgrade to new technologies. 2026 2026 HVAC Supplemental Data Sheet [XLSX] 2026 HVAC Supplemental Data Sheet [PDF] 2026 Cooling Eligibility Screening Tool [XLSX] Learn More Apply Now Laboratory Energy Efficiency Improvements to equipment, controls, and surrounding environments can yield considerable savings for businesses of any size. 2026 Apply Now Lighting Save time, money, and headaches with advanced lighting technologies for your building. 2026 2026 Lighting Rebate Supplemental Data Sheet [XLSX] 2026 Lighting Rebate Supplemental Data Sheet [PDF] 2026 New Construction Interior Lighting Workbook [XLSM] Lighting Measures 'At-A-Glance' [PDF] Lighting Controls Decision Tree [PDF]", "https://focusonenergy.com/business/propane": "Propane Fueled Equipment | Focus on Energy New Blog Post: Planting Knowledge for a Better Future >> About Us News Events and Training Find a Trade Ally Contact English English Español Products Free Energy-Saving Packs Online Marketplace Equipment Explore all Rebates Services Building Optimization Energy Assessments Energy Management New Construction & Renovations Technical Support Explore all Rebates Rebates & Incentives Learn more about our Rebates and Incentives. Explore all Rebates Residential Heating & Cooling Insulation & Air Sealing DIY Insulation & Air Sealing Smart Thermostats Residential Efficient Pumps Water Heating Solar for Homes New Home Certification Income-Qualified Rebates IRA Home Energy Rebates Business Equipment Replacement Rebates for Businesses Custom Incentives Renewables for Businesses Special Offerings New Construction & Renovations Operations & Maintenance Solutions Agribusiness Commercial Real Estate Education Government Healthcare Hospitality Manufacturing Multifamily Nonprofits Restaurants Retail & Grocery Tribal Nations Water & Wastewater Facilities Explore all Rebates Renewables Solar for Homes Renewables for Businesses Explore all Rebates Resources Participating Utilities Blog Renter Resources Financing and Funding Resources Find a Trade Ally Contractor Energy Advisor Directory Real Estate Ambassador Program Community Based Organizations Career Exploration Workshops Future Focus Initiative Payment Look-up Utility Resources Trade Ally Resources FAQs Explore all Rebates Get Started Get Started Home / Business / Propane Fueled Equipment For Agriculture Propane Fueled Equipment Funding is limited and allocated on a first-come, first-served basis. To secure your spot, you must formally reserve funds. Contact an Energy Advisor today to check availability and start your reservation. Do you use propane for your farm or agribusiness? Focus on Energy, in partnership with the Office of Energy Innovation (OEI), is offering energy efficiency rebates for agricultural customers who currently use propane to fuel specific equipment. Funding for rebates related to energy-efficient propane equipment has been made possible through a federal US Department of Energy State Energy Program grant to the PSC WI-OEI. These rebates are delivered in partnership with Focus on Energy through its statewide network of energy advisors. Find an Energy Advisor Technologies Include Equipment Rebate Boilers & Heaters $2.75-$8/MBh Furnaces $150-$420/furnace depending on efficiency Water Heaters $1,000/unit Refrigeration Heat Recovery Units $1,250/unit Grain Dryers Rebate $8-$20/Bushel/hr drying capacity Get Started Today! 1 Get Started Identify energy-efficient technology by reviewing the Propane Fueled Equipment Insert. View the Agribusiness Catalog 2 Qualifications All measures saving propane fuel are eligible for propane rebates regardless of the electric utility’s participation status in Focus on Energy. The measure funded and any connected actions necessary to implement the project cannot result in any ground disturbance, tree removal, or tree trimming. 3 Submit Applications Complete the Rebate Application for pre-approval, along with the Agribusiness Rebate Supplemental Data Sheet. Submit completion notice, invoices, and Federal Funding acknowledgment when the project is complete. Acknowledgements of Propane Can’t find a specific type of technology? Call 800.762.7077 to find out if your equipment qualifies for a rebate. Join our newsletter to stay up-to-date. Need answers? Try our Help Center. Help Center Looking for something specific? © 2026 Focus on Energy Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy", "https://focusonenergy.com/residential/real-estate-ambassador-welcome-gift": "Real Estate Ambassador Welcome Gift | Focus on Energy New Blog Post: Planting Knowledge for a Better Future >> About Us News Events and Training Find a Trade Ally Contact English English Español Products Free Energy-Saving Packs Online Marketplace Equipment Explore all Rebates Services Building Optimization Energy Assessments Energy Management New Construction & Renovations Technical Support Explore all Rebates Rebates & Incentives Learn more about our Rebates and Incentives. Explore all Rebates Residential Heating & Cooli