centives for All Project Stages New buildings and renovations at any stage of design or construction can take advantage of support from Focus on Energy. EDA Comprehensive offering for projects over 5,000 square feet, early in design. Includes free whole-building energy analysis with incentives for building owners and… Income-Qualified Housing EDA Provides services unique to affordable multifamily development. Includes initial eEDA analysis plus customized financial modeling and additional consulting. eEDA Online, self-guided energy modeling tool for project planners and design teams. Delivers time-saving analysis for multifamily, warehouse, and retail new… EDR Whole-building analysis for buildings further along in design. Like EDA, owner incentives are based on the building's overall energy savings. Rebates and Incentives For projects past the design phase. New energy-efficient products and equipment can still qualify. New Construction Online Tool Get started with our New Construction Online Tool and be guided to incentives for your project. New Construction Online Tool Sign up to receive the latest on New Construction offerings. Sign Up Featured Content Multifamily New Construction Focus on Energy has supported more than 250 multifamily new construction projects, helping Wisconsin building owners save over $12 million in annual energy costs. If you're considering or in the process of building a new multifamily property, look to Focus on Energy to maximize your energy savings opportunities. Read More Express Energy Design Assistance Express Energy Design Assistance (eEDA) is a streamlined online modeling tool to help project planners and design teams quickly evaluate whole-building energy efficiency incentives for multifamily, warehouse, and retail projects starting at 5,000 square feet. Read More Join our newsletter to stay up-to-date. Need answers? Try our Help Cent", "https://assets.focusonenergy.com/production/images/business/BNC-Online-Tool-AdobeStock_610553740