ithout compromising performance—allowing you to use less water and potentially lowering water and heating bills. Pipe Insulation Pipe insulation may be used on domestic cold and hot water pipes. Pipe insulation will help to reduce heat loss by up to 80% through hot water pipes and will stop sweating on cold water pipes. Family Room There’s nothing more special than the time we spend with the ones we love. Make those moments even more special with the Family Room pack, featuring products to illuminate, insulate, and manage energy use in shared spaces. Products like LED lights for better visibility during board game night, and weatherstripping and window film to maintain cozy temps will make your common rooms feel extraordinary. Clean Up Your Energy Usage Bathroom Keeping up with hygiene has never felt so clean! The Bathroom pack is stuffed with products that will help scrub away the feeling of energy waste, like a water-saving showerhead, pipe insulation wraps, and an LED nightlight, so you wash up without feeling washed out. Every product will help reduce electricity and water use while keeping a high level of performance and comfort. Make a Savings Splash Kitchen Family, friends, and food come together in the kitchen, and this pack helps make sure that time spent prepping food or simply hanging out isn’t wasting energy. You’ll use less water without sacrificing pressure with a faucet aerator, get more consistent water temperature with pipe insulation wrap, and you can keep your late-night snack missions a secret with an LED nightlight. Chop Your Energy Costs Ready to Pack Up? Complete our online order form to choose the pack that works best for you. Keep your utility account information handy. Then, once your pack arrives, install your products and enjoy the energy", "https://focusonenergy.com/residential/appliance-recycling": "Appliance Recycling - No Longer Available | Focus on Energy New Blog Post: Planting Knowledge for a Better Future >> About Us News Events a